TFEsItW2Q5Qrfv9CZYO0MDRM_HYCxa2ECL7R8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR2o9Yr_XPiNZKA0vxfU7L-VQA63gywxaSLYox5Whq3sg&oe=6AFB2CFA"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_5.png", "id": "2388819905255937", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596149727_2388819911922603_6634828631457484306_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QvZVjDGufuEQ7kNvwHn7bIs&_nc_oc=AdrC-Few-jkO7uqMYihFOxzpNVqt00ibG0PrPV_9BLRNbj1d1SZ1ERGsXnrgQ6B-lCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRAvWjJhdQBt7xJpCQT1JIzJuYivTfD-Vq13aDpD8slxw&oe=6AFB3BBC"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_4.png", "id": "1158189797213362", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831964_1158189800546695_1011865861156124106_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-VEtj64fnLYQ7kNvwEutrQ7&_nc_oc=Adon7pBx0pLU1gZfi8Jm-OJWkir8wDSiJEPLB5uTGmgRvkkSnqj-RGXkhUiN41QbKos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjD1uyCD8SL6wUJ0n81mACcZI3-XVAgTbvE6zpBnwvFw&oe=6AFB2520"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover.png", "id": "1036543396115245", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_1036543399448578_163835344896426654_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4XRYalzX13wQ7kNvwF1z7QM&_nc_oc=AdqEVRUomW31SjlPz8zytGgTR8OjuEfJdY_5S3PFc0-jZ2CMb-5Kr3gTOipoE4APTzk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSLzCDEfheVEhCSnAMTNcUk9fFzyJ8IOWX-lC7UdSb25w&oe=6AFB3785"}, "display_name": "Flight Simulator South Korea", "keywords": ["flight", "simulator", "korea", "seoul", "jet"], "long_description": "Flight Simulator South Korea puts you in the captain's seat over the real Seoul, the Han river and the Yellow Sea coast.\n\nTHE REAL SEOUL\nLotte World Tower, N Seoul Tower on Namsan, the 63 Building and the Yeouido towers, with Bukhansan, Gwanaksan and Inwangsan at their real heights.\n\nPALACES AND LANDMARKS\nGyeongbokgung, Gwanghwamun, Sungnyemun, Heunginjimun, Dongdaemun Design Plaza, City Hall, the National Assembly, the Olympic and World Cup stadiums.\n\nTHE HAN RIVER\nFly the Han past its bridges from Jamsil to Yeouido, out to the estuary and the Yellow Sea, the Incheon Bridge and Songdo.\n\nA LIVING CITY\nTrains on their real tracks, traffic on the real roads, tour boats on the Han and ships off Incheon. At night the towers and bridges light up.\n\nAIR TRAFFIC CONTROL\nTaxi and takeoff clearances and your landing clearance.\n\nYOUR GLASS HANGAR\nEvery flight starts in your glass hangar in Olympic Park, Lotte World Tower through the doors. Repaint, wash, fly.\n\nFOUR AIRCRAFT\nTwo private jets with cabins, a midsize jet and a fighter.\n\nELEVEN MISSIONS\nGimpo and Incheon approaches, the Han River Run, around Lotte World Tower, the Incheon Bridge, a Seoul Air Base scramble, Seoul by night, a city tour.\n\nFLY TOGETHER ONLINE\nQuick Match or a private sky with a code. Voice chat stays off until you turn it on.\n\nEnglish and Korean menus.", "short_description": "Fly the real Seoul: Lotte World Tower, N Seoul Tower on Namsan, the 63 Building and Yeouido, Gyeongbokgung Palace, the Han river and its bridges, Bukhansan and the Incheon Bridge. Start in your own glass hangar in Olympic Park, circle Lotte World Tower, talk to air traffic control and land at Gimpo. English and Korean menus."}]}, "developer_name": "Citiview Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/flightsimulatorsouthkorea/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Citiview Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://citiview-games.pages.dev/flightsimulatorsouthkorea/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132